---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-white/10 bg-navy-950 text-slate-300">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-4">
      <!-- 品牌 -->
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center" aria-label="PRESSUREPOINT home">
          <img src="/logo/logo-horizontal-light.svg" alt="PRESSUREPOINT" class="h-8 w-auto" />
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          PRESSUREPOINT is a pressure transducer and pressure transmitter manufacturer, selling factory-direct to engineers, distributors and OEMs worldwide.
          Factory-direct rotating unions for water, air, steam and hydraulic
          service, with OEM/ODM support for distributors and integrators.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <a href="mailto:cj226144@gmail.com" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm transition hover:text-white">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.8" stroke="currentColor" class="h-4 w-4"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 19.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.07-1.916V6.75" /></svg>
